  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Pham",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Pham.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Veronica Pham (MED0002666470) completed her medical degree at the University of Queensland. She has worked in Princess Alexandria Hospital in Brisbane and Liverpool Hospital in Sydney before commencing her career in general practice. She has worked in Wagga Wagga as a GP Registrar. She is passionate about all areas of general practice, with particular interest in preventative health, chronic disease management, women's health, paediatrics and emergency medicine.",
      "In her spare time she enjoys spending time with friends and family as well as travelling."
    ]
  },
